---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Real Playback Speed" description="Privacy policy for Real Playback Speed. Learn how we handle your information on playback speed calculator.">
  <section class="section-container" style="padding: var(--spacing-3xl) var(--spacing-lg); max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: var(--font-size-body-sm); font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-link);">Privacy Policy</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-xl); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-xl); color: var(--color-ink); margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-lg);">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      Last updated: November 2026
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      Real Playback Speed ("we," "us," or "our") operates the playback speed calculator at realplaybackspeed.com. This page informs you of our policies regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of personal data.
    </p>
    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Information Collection</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      Our calculator runs entirely in your browser. We do not collect, store, or share personal data, video files, or YouTube URLs you enter. Duration lookups are made server-side anonymously and no identifiable information is retained.
    </p>
    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Cookies</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      We use cookies only to remember your language, device, and theme preferences locally in your browser. No tracking or analytics cookies are used.
    </p>
    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Third-Party Sites</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      Our site links to YouTube, Spotify, Netflix, TikTok, and Instagram. Those services have their own privacy policies, and we are not responsible for their practices.
    </p>
    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Contact Us</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      If you have questions about this privacy policy, contact us via our <a href="/contact" style="color: var(--color-link);">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
